          "end": 4.793,
          "en": "and lock them in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.793,
          "end": 7.35,
          "en": "let's make sure we can also lock them out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.35,
          "end": 9.12,
          "en": "For this, I already got the logout button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.12,
          "end": 10.29,
          "en": "in this form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.29,
          "end": 12.84,
          "en": "but I'm now going to tweak this a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "For one, I'll add a method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "to set this to post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 19.86,
          "en": "We could also use the Remix form instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.86,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "and we could of course also use delete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 23.67,
          "en": "for example, as a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 23.67,
          "end": 28.17,
          "en": "because logging out can be seen as deleting something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.17,
          "end": 30.273,
          "en": "You delete the session, after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 32.64,
          "en": "Nonetheless, here I'll use post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.64,
          "end": 34.68,
          "en": "but you can use either of the two approaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.68,
          "end": 36.603,
          "en": "and it is really up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 40.71,
          "en": "I'll also add an idea of log out dash form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 42.57,
          "en": "for styling purposes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.57,
          "end": 44.87,
          "en": "but what's now really important is the action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 48.93,
          "en": "Thus far, in most forms we haven't really",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.93,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "added actions because I was typically fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 53.43,
          "en": "with sending the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 55.413,
          "en": "to the route that's currently active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "In case of the main navigation bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 60.48,
          "en": "different routes can be active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 60.48,
          "end": 62.07,
          "en": "The main navigation bar is shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 64.533,
          "en": "for the pricing at the homepage, after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 68.07,
          "en": "Therefore I don't wanna send it to the active page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.07,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "but to a different page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 72.87,
          "en": "Here it would make sense to send this request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.87,
          "end": 75.783,
          "en": "to slash logout, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "However, we have no logout route yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.5,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "but of course, we can simply create one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 85.17,
          "en": "In the routes folder we can add a logout file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 85.17,
          "end": 88.59,
          "en": "and I'll simply name it logout.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.59,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "and that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 90.9,
          "en": "Not .jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 92.703,
          "en": "but just .js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.6,
          "end": 95.75999999999999,
          "en": "The reason for that is, that in this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.75999999999999,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "I actually won't have any component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 103.17,
          "en": "I guess that was already the case for Expenses.raw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 103.17,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "Indeed, we could also rename this to .js for that reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "because .jsx is only needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 111.333,
          "en": "if you have some JSX code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112.5,
          "end": 114.9,
          "en": "Here it's .js because in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 114.9,
          "end": 116.58,
          "en": "for this logout route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 116.58,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "I don't support any get requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 118.56,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "I don't render any page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "Instead I just wanna export an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 127.05,
          "en": "An action because this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 127.05,
          "end": 130.08,
          "en": "will be triggered through a post request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 130.08,
          "end": 133.32,
          "en": "The post request submitted by this form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 133.32,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "Therefore here in this action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 136.86,
          "en": "I know that it should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 136.86,
          "end": 139.29,
          "en": "because of a post request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 141.24,
          "en": "We could also add some check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 141.24,
          "end": 143.07,
          "en": "checking the request method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 143.07,
          "end": 147.57,
          "en": "by using the request object, which we get here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 147.57,
          "end": 151.47,
          "en": "We could check if request method is not post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 155.07,
          "en": "in which case, we could throw a new error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 155.07,
          "end": 158.73,
          "en": "where we say invalid request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 160.89,
          "en": "We could also throw a new response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 160.89,
          "end": 162.99,
          "en": "a new error response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 165.21,
          "en": "by using the Jason function, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 169.09,
          "en": "with a message of invalid request method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 174.6,
          "en": "and a status code of 400.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 175.653,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.03,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "If we make it past as if check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 179.61,
          "en": "we know that it's valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 182.73,
          "en": "we know that it's a post request in the logout route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 182.73,
          "end": 185.973,
          "en": "and we therefore wanna delete the session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 186.96,
          "end": 191.73,
          "en": "Now for this we'll head back to the auth.server.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 193.38,
          "en": "and in there I'll add yet another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.38,
          "end": 195.42,
          "en": "new function which is exported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 195.42,
          "end": 196.54,
          "en": "and that is D",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "Destroy user session function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 202.773,
          "en": "which will do what the name implies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 203.94,
          "end": 206.16,
          "en": "I expect to get a request here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 206.16,
          "end": 207.84,
          "en": "and then in there I'll first of all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 207.84,
          "end": 210.36,
          "en": "get my session again with the same code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.36,
          "end": 212.733,
          "en": "I used for get user from session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 213.87,
          "end": 215.82,
          "en": "Now, once I have that session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 215.82,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "we can call sessionStorage.destroySession",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 221.67000000000002,
          "end": 223.263,
          "en": "and pass this session to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 224.1,
          "end": 226.8,
          "en": "Now destroySession, as the name suggests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 226.8,
          "end": 228.63,
          "en": "destroys the session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 228.63,
          "end": 231.45,
          "en": "and it also returns a promise that yields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 231.45,
          "end": 233.88,
          "en": "a string that should be set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 233.88,
          "end": 237.453,
          "en": "for a set cookie on a response returned to the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 238.56,
          "end": 240.78,
          "en": "Because of course, the session cookie must also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 240.78,
          "end": 243.36,
          "en": "be deleted from the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 243.36,
          "end": 245.73,
          "en": "Just as the cookie is created by",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 245.73,
          "end": 249.51,
          "en": "setting some headers on a response sent to the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 249.51,
          "end": 251.97,
          "en": "it's also destroyed by setting some headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 251.97,
          "end": 254.373,
          "en": "on a response sent to the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 255.27,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "Here in destroyUserSession,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 261.21,
          "en": "I'll return a response, a redirect response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 261.21,
          "end": 264.39,
          "en": "to let's say just slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 264.39,
          "end": 266.46,
          "en": "We could, of course, also make this more dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 266.46,
          "end": 270.15,
          "en": "again by accepting the redirect path as a parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 270.15,
          "end": 271.89300000000003,
          "en": "but here are hard coded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 272.79,
          "end": 277.14,
          "en": "Then the configuration object for this response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 277.14,
          "end": 279.87,
          "en": "Make sure that a header's keys added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 279.87,
          "end": 282.783,
          "en": "There again, it's the set cookie header that's added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 283.68,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "and the value of that is the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 288.42,
          "en": "returned by destroySession.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 288.42,
          "end": 289.92,
          "en": "Now this returns a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 289.92,
          "end": 291.87,
          "en": "so we have to await this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 291.87,
          "end": 295.44,
          "en": "Then this resolved value is the value set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 295.44,
          "end": 296.613,
          "en": "for a set cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 298.02,
          "end": 300.33,
          "en": "That's how we clear the session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 300.33,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "With that back in the logout route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 307.38,
          "en": "we have to call destroyUserSession",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 307.38,
          "end": 310.95,
          "en": "and pass our request object to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 310.95,
          "end": 313.89,
          "en": "and then return the result of destroyUserSession",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 313.89,
          "end": 316.323,
          "en": "which is that response that clears the cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 317.4,
          "end": 318.78,
          "en": "With all that in place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 318.78,
          "end": 321.06,
          "en": "if we go back, I have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 321.06,
          "end": 325.77,
          "en": "That form is not defined because in main header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 325.77,
          "end": 328.44,
          "en": "I probably forgot to add the import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 328.44,
          "end": 331.88,
          "en": "Form must be imported from Remix Run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 331.88,
          "end": 335.34000000000003,
          "en": "With that though, this is looking better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 335.34000000000003,
          "end": 337.53,
          "en": "The logout button is there again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 337.53,
          "end": 339.99,
          "en": "and now if I click it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 339.99,
          "end": 344.223,
          "en": "you see it's replaced with the log in button again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 345.12,
          "end": 346.44,
          "en": "I also was redirected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 346.44,
          "end": 348.18,
          "en": "but I already was on the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 348.18,
          "end": 349.47,
          "en": "so we didn't see that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 349.47,
          "end": 351.54,
          "en": "We can tell that the session was cleared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 351.54,
          "end": 354.21,
          "en": "by the fact that the login button appears again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 354.21,
          "end": 355.71,
          "en": "because this proves that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 355.71,
          "end": 358.35,
          "en": "we no longer get a valid user ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 358.35,
          "end": 360.33,
          "en": "when taking a look at our cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 360.33,
          "end": 362.31,
          "en": "because we don't have a cookie anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 362.31,
          "end": 364.053,
          "en": "We don't have a session anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 364.92,
